<title>GERMANY: Continental shares rise on 96 figures.</title>
<headline>Continental shares rise on 96 figures.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in the German tyre-maker Continental AG rose sharply in bourse trade on Wednesday, up one mark, or 2.8 percent, at 34.80 marks, after the group reported strong 1996 figures.</p>
<p>The overall DAX index was also strongly ahead, up 1.03 percent at 3,354.95 points in late bourse trade.</p>
<p>Continental said that group pre-tax profit increased 68.2 percent to 328 million, while group sales were up 1.7 percent at 10.4 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
